.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/ksm2wwezfjq3y0ofwqpzf5cmkkhs9sa.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%AE%88%E6%8A%A4.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/07/ksm2wwezfjq3y0ofwqpzf5cmkkhs9sa.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />守护\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）替自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>格内所有友军承受[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">物理攻击</span>]。发动时，防御提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">20%</font>。每回合最多生效<font color=\"#ed7950\">1</font>次。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E9%9C%B2%E8%A5%BF%E4%BA%9A%E8%9B%AE%E7%86%8A%E7%9B%BE%E5%8D%AB\" title=\"角色图鉴库/露西亚蛮熊盾卫\"><img alt=\"头像 露西亚蛮熊盾卫.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/7/7d/sb294ycnprabx7uz36uto3mhp8czrkp.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">露西亚蛮熊盾卫</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E6%B3%95%E7%9A%87%E5%9B%BD%E5%89%91%E7%9B%BE%E5%85%B5\" title=\"角色图鉴库/法皇国剑盾兵\"><img alt=\"头像 法皇国剑盾兵.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f5/9tht87620kv9wkffmvezm15tczfk5v9.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<